OL,3,GNEWSAFire crew attacked with fireworks
OL,4,Aas they put out blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFireworks were launched at a fire crew
OL,7,Fas they tried to put out an
OL,8,Fout-of-control bonfire.
OL,10,FThey were in Greenthorn Crescent in
OL,11,FPreston trying to deal with a blaze
OL,12,Fthat had spread to a lamp post when
OL,13,Fthey came under attack.
OL,15,FLancashire Fire and Rescue Service's
OL,16,Fchief fire officer Jon Charters said
OL,17,Fwhile no-one was hurt, it was a
OL,18,F"reckless, dangerous and utterly
OL,19,Funacceptable act".
OL,21,FA 14-year-old boy was arrested and
OL,22,Fbailed, Lancashire Police said.
